  "The Tsukihime remake, Tsukihime -A piece of blue glass moon-, and all of its story, art, music and voices belong to TYPE-MOON, Aniplex and the other rights holders. This project is unofficial and non-commercial, and is not affiliated with or endorsed by them. Please support the official release.": "月姬重制版《月姬 -A piece of blue glass moon-》及其全部故事、美术、音乐和语音均属于 TYPE-MOON、Aniplex 及其他权利人。本项目是非官方、非商业的，与他们无关，也未获得他们的认可。请支持正版。",
