  "The native port is based on the SuperMarioWonderRecomp recompilation framework by BelmanteGu. Ryujinx's shader translator was used offline. Ghidra was used for decompilation, FFmpeg, SVT-AV1 and Pillow for the conversions. Some menus are set in Inter, under the SIL Open Font License.": "原生移植基于 BelmanteGu 的 SuperMarioWonderRecomp 重编译框架。离线使用了 Ryujinx 的着色器转换器。反编译使用 Ghidra，转换使用 FFmpeg、SVT-AV1 和 Pillow。部分菜单使用 Inter 字体，遵循 SIL Open Font License。",
  "How it was written": "它是怎样写成的",
  "This was built with Claude, Anthropic's AI model, under human direction: the goals, the decisions and the playing and judging of every result were human, and most of the code was written by the AI.": "它是在人的指导下，借助 Anthropic 的 AI 模型 Claude 制作的：目标、决定，以及对每个结果的试玩和评判都由人完成，大部分代码由 AI 编写。",
  "DOWNLOAD": "下载",
  "Download the game": "下载游戏",
  "Downloaded the app before 13 November 2026? Please download it again: those first versions cannot update themselves. They open straight on the game's title, not on a page of tabs like this one. On Android, install the new one over the old one; on Windows, extract it and play from the new folder. Your saves stay.": "在 2026 年 11 月 13 日之前下载过应用？请重新下载：那些最初的版本无法自行更新。它们一打开就是游戏的标题画面，而不是像这样带标签页的页面。在 Android 上，把新版本直接安装在旧版本上；在 Windows 上，解压后从新文件夹中游玩。你的存档会保留。",
  "The whole game as an app that needs no connection: every picture, voice, song and movie is inside it, and nothing is fetched while you play. Windows and Android have a download here; for macOS and Linux the same app is built from the source, below.": "整个游戏做成一个无需联网的应用：每张图像、每段语音、每首歌和每部影片都在里面，游玩时不会获取任何东西。Windows 和 Android 可以在这里下载；macOS 和 Linux 则如下文所述，从源代码构建同一个应用。",
  "connections needed": "所需的网络连接",
  "It is this site's game in a window of its own, opening on this page's ABOUT, SAVE DATA, LANGUAGE and PLAY. It is in English; 日本語 and 中文 are downloaded inside it the first time they are chosen on LANGUAGE (about 100 MB). Saves are kept in the app, apart from this site's, and stay when a newer version replaces it; SAVE DATA moves progress between the app and this site as a file. Leaving the app makes the automatic save, so you come back to where you were.": "它是本站的游戏，放在一个独立的窗口里，打开时是本页的“关于”“存档”“语言”和“游玩”。它是英文的；日本語和中文在“语言”中第一次选择时，会在应用内下载（约 100 MB）。存档保存在应用中，与本站的分开，新版本替换旧版本时也会保留；“存档”可以把进度以文件的形式在应用和本站之间转移。离开应用时会自动存档，所以回来时可以从原处继续。",
  "The app keeps itself up to date: when it opens with a connection it looks here for a newer version, asks, and downloads only the files that changed, so a fix is not this download again.": "应用会自行保持最新：联网打开时，它会在这里查找新版本，询问后只下载有变化的文件，所以修复不需要再次进行这个大下载。",
  "Needs": "需要",
  "Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit.": "Windows 10 或更新版本，64 位。",
  "1. Download": "1. 下载",
  "Tsukihime-win-x64.zip, below.": "下方的 Tsukihime-win-x64.zip。",
  "2. Extract": "2. 解压",
  "Right-click the file and choose Extract All, into a folder of its own. There is nothing to install.": "右键单击该文件，选择“全部解压缩”，解压到一个单独的文件夹中。无需安装任何东西。",
  "3. Play": "3. 游玩",
  "Open Tsukihime.exe in that folder. Windows may say it does not know the publisher: choose More info, then Run anyway.": "打开该文件夹中的 Tsukihime.exe。Windows 可能会提示无法识别发布者：选择“更多信息”，然后选择“仍要运行”。",
  "Android 8 or newer. Its one permission is the internet, which it uses only to look for and download its updates from this site.": "Android 8 或更新版本。它唯一的权限是互联网，只用于从本站查找和下载更新。",
  "Tsukihime.apk, below, on the phone itself. It is large, so Wi-Fi is best.": "在手机上直接下载下方的 Tsukihime.apk。文件很大，最好使用 Wi-Fi。",
  "2. Open it": "2. 打开",
  "From the browser's downloads. Android asks whether that browser may install apps: allow it.": "从浏览器的下载列表中打开。Android 会询问是否允许该浏览器安装应用：选择允许。",
  "3. Install": "3. 安装",
  "As much space again must be free while it installs. Afterwards the download can be deleted.": "安装期间还需要再有同样大小的可用空间。安装完成后可以删除下载的文件。",
  "It plays in landscape, by touch, as this site does on a phone. Android's Back gesture does what the game's own Back button does.": "它横屏运行，用触摸操作，与在手机上玩本站时一样。Android 的返回手势与游戏自己的返回按钮作用相同。",
  "macOS and Linux": "macOS 和 Linux",
  "There is no download for these yet. The app is the same one, built from the source; the game's own files are not in the repository, and one command fetches them from this site.": "这两个平台暂时还没有下载。应用是同一个，从源代码构建；游戏本身的文件不在仓库中，一条命令即可从本站获取。",
  "Git, Python 3, Node.js with npm, and about 20 GB free while it builds. A Mac with macOS 13 or newer for the Mac app; the Linux one is for 64-bit (x86) systems.": "Git、Python 3、带 npm 的 Node.js，以及构建期间约 20 GB 的可用空间。Mac 版需要 macOS 13 或更新版本的 Mac；Linux 版适用于 64 位（x86）系统。",
  "1. Get the source": "1. 获取源代码",
  "git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/waifwu/TsukiREbuild, then in that folder: python3 web-dev/tools/fetch_assets.py, which downloads the game's files (2.8 GB).": "运行 git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/waifwu/TsukiREbuild，然后在该文件夹中运行 python3 web-dev/tools/fetch_assets.py，它会下载游戏的文件（2.8 GB）。",
  "2. Build": "2. 构建",
  "web-dev/desktop/build.sh mac, or web-dev/desktop/build.sh linux. The first run fetches Electron.": "web-dev/desktop/build.sh mac，或 web-dev/desktop/build.sh linux。第一次运行会获取 Electron。",
  "The app is in web-dev/desktop/out: Tsukihime-mac-universal.dmg (open it, drag Tsukihime to Applications), or Tsukihime-linux-x86_64.AppImage (chmod +x, then open it).": "应用位于 web-dev/desktop/out：Tsukihime-mac-universal.dmg（打开后把 Tsukihime 拖到“应用程序”），或 Tsukihime-linux-x86_64.AppImage（先 chmod +x，再打开）。",
  "How the desktop app is built": "桌面应用的构建方法",
