  "Saves, settings and progress are kept in this browser: clearing the site's data removes them, and another browser or device starts with none.": "存档、设置和进度保存在这个浏览器中：清除本站的数据会把它们删除，换一个浏览器或设备则从零开始。",
  "Export and Import use the Nintendo Switch game's own save format, the file savedata000: the original game reads what Export writes, and a save from the Switch game can be loaded here.": "导出和导入使用 Nintendo Switch 版游戏自己的存档格式，即 savedata000 文件：原版游戏可以读取导出的文件，Switch 版的存档也可以在这里载入。",
  "Export": "导出",
  "Saves the settings and progress shown above as savedata000: the flowchart, the gallery, what has been read.": "把上面显示的设置和进度保存为 savedata000：流程图、鉴赏和已读内容。",
  "Import": "导入",
  "Loads the settings and progress of a savedata000 here. Your own are put aside, not lost.": "把一个 savedata000 的设置和进度载入到这里。你自己的会被暂存，不会丢失。",
  "Remove": "移除",
  "Takes the imported file, or the 100% save, out again, and your own settings and progress are back as they were. The saves you make here are yours throughout.": "把导入的文件或 100% 存档再移除，你自己的设置和进度就会恢复原样。你在这里做的存档始终是你的。",
  "100% save": "100% 存档",
  "Loads a finished game's progress, with everything open. It warns and asks first; your own progress is put aside, and your settings stay.": "载入一个已通关的游戏进度，所有内容都已解锁。它会先警告并询问；你自己的进度会被暂存，设置保持不变。",
