  "Export and Import use the Nintendo Switch game's own save format, the file savedata000: the original game reads what Export writes, and a save from the Switch game can be loaded here. The website's SAVE DATA page reads and writes the same file, so progress goes between the two that way.": "导出和导入使用 Nintendo Switch 版游戏自己的存档格式，即 savedata000 文件：原版游戏可以读取导出的文件，Switch 版的存档也可以在这里载入。网站的“存档”页面读写的是同一个文件，因此可以借此在两者之间转移进度。",
  "PLAY": "游玩",
